ComicCraft – AI Comic Story Creator Using Gemini Models
Requirement Analysis
1. Project Overview
ComicCraft is an AI-powered web application that helps users create comic stories using Google Gemini models. Users provide a story idea, characters, genre, or a simple prompt, and the system uses AI to generate a structured comic storyline, dialogue, scene descriptions, and optionally visual assets.
The main objective is to make comic creation accessible to users who may not have professional writing, illustration, or comic-design skills.
2. Problem Statement
Creating a comic traditionally requires several skills:
•	Story writing and plot development
•	Character creation
•	Dialogue writing
•	Scene planning
•	Illustration
•	Panel arrangement
•	Editing and formatting
This can be time-consuming and difficult for beginners. ComicCraft addresses this problem by combining AI-based story generation with a structured comic-creation workflow.
3. Objectives
The system should:
1.	Allow users to enter a basic comic idea or prompt.
2.	Generate a complete story using Gemini.
3.	Generate characters and character descriptions.
4.	Divide the story into comic scenes/panels.
5.	Generate dialogue and narration for each panel.
6.	Provide AI-generated image prompts or comic artwork where supported.
7.	Allow users to edit generated content.
8.	Allow users to preview the comic.
9.	Allow users to save and manage their comic projects.
10.	Allow users to export the completed comic.
