14. Basic User Workflow
1.	User logs into ComicCraft.
2.	User selects Create New Comic.
3.	User enters a story idea.
4.	User selects genre and art style.
5.	Gemini generates the story.
6.	User reviews and edits the story.
7.	Gemini generates characters.
8.	Story is divided into scenes/panels.
9.	Dialogue and narration are generated.
10.	Visual prompts/images are generated.
11.	User edits the comic.
12.	User previews the final comic.
13.	User exports the comic.
