16. Minimum Viable Product (MVP)
For a college/project implementation, the MVP can focus on:
Login → Story Prompt → Gemini Story Generation → Character Generation → Panel/Dialogue Generation → Comic Editor → Preview → PDF Export
This keeps the core AI functionality demonstrable without making the first version unnecessarily complex.

